      "We serve Western Massachusetts from our Enfield, Connecticut warehouse, just over the state line, and Belchertown is one of our longer runs at 40 to 50 minutes, usually up through [Ludlow](/movers-ludlow-ma/) on Route 21 or around through [Amherst](/movers-amherst-ma/) on Route 9. We're upfront about the distance, and the estimate reflects it: no surprises on moving day.",
